# Scripts and repo files that should not be applied to $HOME by chezmoi.
Brewfile
./*.sh
./AGENTS.md
./CLAUDE.md
./CONTEXT.md
./README.md

# Machine-local: these carry a pairing `Co-authored-by` trailer that should stay
# live-only, so chezmoi must not apply the trailer-free source over it. The
# source copies are kept for reference but are no longer deployed — edit the
# live files directly.
.config/jj/config.toml
.gitmessage

# App-managed state, not static config: Claude Code itself rewrites this file
# when you change model, toggle plugins, or edit settings in-app, so chezmoi can
# never win against it. The tracked copy also deliberately omits the private
# `ai-os` marketplace (this repo is public), which means applying it would strip
# ai-os and break those skills. Edit ~/.claude/settings.json directly; the
# source copy stays as a reference for hooks/statusline on a new machine.
.claude/settings.json
